{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cft3mNtuFejt9KxjR6V1L","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QMQ8vN3SKapafqBiyGP6nv","name":"StructuredOutput","input":{"stops":[{"line":"T1","id":"comet","name":"Comet Row","path":"trunk","at":[0,-680],"fronts":"boulevard"},{"line":"T1","id":"records","name":"Records","path":"trunk","at":[0,-375],"interchange":"T2/market","fronts":"boulevard"},{"line":"T1","id":"circus","name":"Crown Circus","path":"trunk","at":[0,-72],"interchange":"S1/circus","fronts":"boulevard"},{"line":"T2","id":"lantern","name":"Lantern Gate","path":"trunk","at":[-349.5,-563],"fronts":"sunset-way"},{"line":"T2","id":"market","name":"Market Street","path":"trunk","at":[-125,-410],"interchange":"T1/records","fronts":"market-street"},{"line":"T2","id":"harbour-east","name":"Harbour Court","path":"trunk","at":[309.5,-350],"fronts":"harbour-road"},{"line":"T2","id":"harbour","name":"Harbour","path":"trunk","at":[309.5,-35],"interchange":"S1/harbour","fronts":"harbour-road"},{"line":"S1","id":"gardens","name":"Sphere Gardens","path":"trunk","at":[-160,0],"length":50,"fronts":"circus-road"},{"line":"S1","id":"circus","name":"Crown Circus","path":"trunk","at":[95,0],"length":50,"interchange":"T1/circus","fronts":"crown-parade"},{"line":"S1","id":"harbour","name":"Harbour","path":"trunk","at":[315,0],"length":50,"interchange":"T2/harbour","fronts":"harbour-road"},{"line":"S1","id":"skyport","name":"Skyport","path":"trunk","at":[530,0],"length":50,"fronts":"skyport-pier"}],"notes":["What changed: I moved the T2 stops onto Datum's redrawn track. The track now runs at x ±309.5/-349.5, so my old stops at x -346 and x 306 were 3.5 m off the line and failed N-P1 (limit 3 m). Lantern, Harbour Court and Harbour now sit exactly on x -349.5 or x 309.5. T1 and S1 are unchanged. These are hand checks only: run `bun tools/plan/cli.ts` and confirm exit 0 before accepting.","Market moves from (-82,-410) to (-125,-410), on the straight diagonal between Datum's two r200 fillets (straight from about x -156 to x -94). At x -82 the platform would have sat on the eastern fillet, which runs from about x -94 to x -66, and failed T-S2. The new 30 m platform spans about x -140 to -110 and stays on straight track. It is on Market Street's centreline.","I rejected Datum's suggested site near (40,-416.5). It leaves Rocket West 256 m from the nearest stop (N-R1 fails at 250), and it opens a 529 m gap after Lantern (T-S1 fails). At (-125,-410), Rocket West is 177 m from Market.","T2 distances along the line from the south edge (R50 bends 78.5 m, r200 fillets about 28.7 m): Lantern s217, Market s580, Harbour Court s1060, Harbour s1375. The gaps are 363, 480 and 315 m, so T-S1 passes. Harbour Court moves to z -350 to keep the middle gap under 500 m. Its platform, z -365 to -335, stays clear of the bend's end at z -366.5.","Interchanges, all under the 150 m limit: T2 Market to T1 Records 130 m, T2 Harbour to S1 Harbour 35 m, T1 Circus to S1 Circus 119 m. The network is one connected whole.","N-R1 closest calls: Lantern South is 105 m from T1 Comet, Docks East 169 m from Harbour Court, and Crown Terraces and Crescent North about 247 m from S1, all under 250 m.","W-3: every T2 stop lies inside the carriageway of the road it fronts. S1 Harbour is 3 m beyond Harbour Road's edge, within the 6 m allowed."],"sources":["538618090dd534247cab5493","ba506de42600790962a866a2","7dfdfdf13043a24e8e964b0b","8753ed1758ca27e6cf152279","e20799f1f673824d09ce452d","0e426f4211a2f1f25c328968"]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10504,"cache_read_input_tokens":3552,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10504},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_manage